                        <p>
                            Think of <strong>Paper Trading</strong> as a flight simulator for stock trading. It gives you <strong>₹1,00,000 of virtual practice money</strong> so you can watch how the automated trading algorithm picks stocks, executes trades, and manages profits and losses in live Indian stock market conditions — <strong>without risking a single rupee of your real savings</strong>!
                        </p>

                        <div class="guide-example-box green-box">
