                            </div>
                            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13.5px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.6;">
                                • <strong>Zero Real Money:</strong> No bank account or Demat balance is ever deducted.<br />
                                • <strong>Real Live Prices:</strong> The bot uses real, live second-by-second NSE stock prices.<br />
                                • <strong>Completely Automated:</strong> Once turned ON, the bot scans, buys, tracks, and sells completely on its own.<br />
                                • <strong>Safe Learning:</strong> Ideal for building confidence and observing performance over days and weeks.
                            </p>
                        </div>
