                        <h3>⚙️ How the Bot Trades (Step-by-Step)</h3>
                        <p>The entire auto paper trading process happens in 4 simple, automated stages:</p>

                        <!-- Step 1 -->
                        <div class="guide-step-card">
                            <div class="guide-step-num">1</div>
                            <div class="guide-step-body">
                                <div class="guide-step-title">Automated Market Scan (Every 15 Minutes)</div>
                                <p class="guide-step-desc">
                                    During official market hours (<strong>09:15 AM to 03:30 PM IST</strong>), the bot automatically wakes up every 15 minutes and scans the top active NSE stocks looking for strong buying momentum.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Step 2 -->
                        <div class="guide-step-card">
                            <div class="guide-step-num">2</div>
                            <div class="guide-step-body">
                                <div class="guide-step-title">Strict Quality Filter Check</div>
                                <p class="guide-step-desc">
                                    The bot does not buy blindly. It verifies that the broader market (NIFTY 50) is healthy, buyer trading volume is unusually high, and the stock is showing a clear upward breakout. If any quality test fails, the stock is rejected.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Step 3 -->
                        <div class="guide-step-card">
                            <div class="guide-step-num">3</div>
                            <div class="guide-step-body">
                                <div class="guide-step-title">Automatic Virtual Buy Entry</div>
                                <p class="guide-step-desc">
                                    When a high-quality stock is detected, the bot automatically buys shares using your allocated trade budget (e.g. ₹20,000 per trade). It logs the entry price, time, and quantity in your dashboard.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Step 4 -->
                        <div class="guide-step-card">
                            <div class="guide-step-num">4</div>
                            <div class="guide-step-body">
                                <div class="guide-step-title">Automatic Target Exit or Stop Loss</div>
                                <p class="guide-step-desc">
                                    The bot continuously watches the stock price tick-by-tick. When the stock gains <strong>+5% profit</strong>, the bot automatically sells and books your virtual profit. If the stock falls by <strong>-3%</strong>, it cuts the position to protect your remaining capital.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
