                <!-- Tab: Stock Order Conditions -->
                <div id="tabPaperConditions" class="qe-modal-pane">
                    <div class="qe-ref-section">
                        <h3>🎯 Background Conditions to Place a Stock BUY Order</h3>
                        <p>
                            To protect your capital and ensure only high-probability stocks are purchased, the bot tests every stock against <strong>3 Gatekeeper Hard Filters</strong>, an <strong>8-Factor Quality Score</strong>, and <strong>5 Pre-Flight Safety Checks</strong> before placing an order.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Section 1: Gatekeeper Rules -->
                        <h4 style="color: #38bdf8; font-size: 14.5px; margin: 18px 0 10px 0; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                            <span>🛡️ STAGE 1: The 3 Gatekeeper Rules (Must Pass 100%)</span>
                        </h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                            If ANY of these 3 rules fail, the stock is <strong>instantly REJECTED</strong>. No order will ever be placed:
                        </p>

                        <div class="guide-def-grid" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                            <div class="guide-def-card" style="border-left: 3px solid #34d399;">
                                <div class="guide-def-term" style="color: #34d399;">✅ 1. Market Filter (Nifty Health)</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">
                                    <strong>What it checks:</strong> Is Nifty 50 trading above its 50-day average?<br />
                                    <strong>Why:</strong> When the overall market is in a deep crash or panic, individual stocks often fall too. The bot refuses to buy in bad market conditions to keep your money safe.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="guide-def-card" style="border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;">
                                <div class="guide-def-term" style="color: #38bdf8;">✅ 2. Stock Upward Trend (Direction)</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">
                                    <strong>What it checks:</strong> Is the stock price above its 20-day and 50-day averages?<br />
                                    <strong>Why:</strong> We only buy stocks that are moving <strong>UPWARDS</strong>. The bot never tries to guess the bottom of falling stocks ("falling knives").
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="guide-def-card" style="border-left: 3px solid #a78bfa;">
                                <div class="guide-def-term" style="color: #a78bfa;">✅ 3. Trend Strength (Power / ADX &ge; 20)</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">
                                    <strong>What it checks:</strong> Is the stock moving with real speed and strength?<br />
                                    <strong>Why:</strong> Filters out slow, flat, sideways stocks that trap your money without making any progress.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Section 2: 8 Quality Factors -->
                        <h4 style="color: #38bdf8; font-size: 14.5px; margin: 22px 0 10px 0; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                            <span>⭐ STAGE 2: 8 Quality Scoring Checks (Need 70+ Points or 10/11 Match)</span>
                        </h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                            Stocks passing the Gatekeeper rules are evaluated across 8 factors totaling up to 100 points. A BUY signal triggers when the score reaches <strong>&ge; 70 Points</strong> (or matches &ge; 10 out of 11 conditions):
                        </p>

                        <div class="guide-example-box" style="margin: 10px 0 20px 0; padding: 14px;">
                            <table class="guide-compare-table" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12.5px;">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr>
                                        <th>Factor</th>
                                        <th>What It Looks For</th>
                                        <th>Points</th>
                                        <th>Simple Reason</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><strong>4. Price Breakout</strong></td>
                                        <td>Crosses yesterday's high or 2-week high</td>
                                        <td><span class="badge bg-primary">+20 Pts</span></td>
                                        <td>Confirms buyers are willing to pay fresh higher prices.</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><strong>5. Heavy Buyer Volume</strong></td>
                                        <td>Volume &ge; 1.5x to 2.5x normal average</td>
                                        <td><span class="badge bg-primary">+15 Pts</span></td>
                                        <td>Big institutions, mutual funds, and smart money are actively buying.</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><strong>6. Beating Nifty 50</strong></td>
                                        <td>Stock return &gt; Nifty 50 over 1 to 3 months</td>
                                        <td><span class="badge bg-primary">+15 Pts</span></td>
                                        <td>Picks market leaders that run faster than ordinary index stocks.</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><strong>7. Hourly Trend Check</strong></td>
                                        <td>60-Minute hourly candle is also bullish</td>
                                        <td><span class="badge bg-primary">+15 Pts</span></td>
                                        <td>Ensures both long-term and short-term trends are pointing in the same direction.</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><strong>8. Healthy Speed (RSI)</strong></td>
                                        <td>RSI index in sweet spot (50 to 75)</td>
                                        <td><span class="badge bg-primary">+10 Pts</span></td>
                                        <td>Has solid upside momentum without being dangerously overheated.</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><strong>9. MACD Indicator</strong></td>
                                        <td>MACD line above signal line</td>
                                        <td><span class="badge bg-primary">+10 Pts</span></td>
                                        <td>Confirms acceleration is positive and speeding up.</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><strong>10. Strong Green Candle</strong></td>
                                        <td>15-min candle closed near highest price</td>
                                        <td><span class="badge bg-primary">+8 Pts</span></td>
                                        <td>Shows aggressive buyers dominated all the way until the close.</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><strong>11. Smart Odds (R:R &ge; 1:2)</strong></td>
                                        <td>Potential profit is at least double the risk</td>
                                        <td><span class="badge bg-primary">+7 Pts</span></td>
                                        <td>Ensures you stand to win ₹2 for every ₹1 potentially risked.</td>
                                    </tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Section 3: Pre-Flight Safety Checks -->
                        <h4 style="color: #38bdf8; font-size: 14.5px; margin: 22px 0 10px 0; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                            <span>🚦 STAGE 3: 5 Account Pre-Flight Checks (Final Clearance)</span>
                        </h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                            Even if a stock scores 90/100, the bot performs 5 final safety checks right before placing the order:
                        </p>

                        <div class="guide-def-grid">
                            <div class="guide-def-card">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">🔘 1. Master Switch is ON</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">If the Auto Trading toggle is OFF, the signal is logged in audit, but no order is placed.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="guide-def-card">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">⏰ 2. Within Market Window</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">Orders are only placed between <strong>09:15 AM and 03:30 PM</strong> on active exchange trading days.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="guide-def-card">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">🚫 3. No Duplicate Positions</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">If you already own RELIANCE from a previous trade today, the bot will never buy it again until closed.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="guide-def-card">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">🛑 4. Under Daily Limit (Max 5)</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">Once 5 auto trades have been executed today, the bot automatically stops taking new trades.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="guide-def-card">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">💵 5. Available Cash Check</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">Your Available Margin must have at least enough cash to cover the fixed trade budget (e.g. ₹20,000).</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

