                <!-- Tab 4: Dashboard Dictionary -->
                <div id="tabPaperDictionary" class="qe-modal-pane">
                    <div class="qe-ref-section">
                        <h3>📖 Plain English Dashboard Dictionary</h3>
                        <p>Confused by trading terms on the screen? Here is what every card and number means in plain English:</p>

                        <div class="guide-def-grid">
                            <div class="guide-def-card">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">🔘 Auto Trading Switch (ON/OFF)</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">The master power button. When <strong>ON</strong>, the bot is active and takes trades. When <strong>OFF</strong>, the bot is paused and will not place any new orders.</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="guide-def-card">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">💵 Available Margin</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">Free cash sitting in your virtual account. This is the money ready to be used for taking upcoming new stock trades.</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="guide-def-card">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">🔒 Used Margin</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">The amount of money currently tied up in your active open stock positions. Once a trade is closed, this money returns to Available Margin.</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="guide-def-card">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">📊 Unrealized P&L (Floating)</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">Live running profit or loss of your current open positions based on the latest market price. It is not permanent until the trade is sold.</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="guide-def-card">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">💰 Realized P&L (Booked)</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">Permanent profit or loss from trades that have been officially closed and sold. This amount is permanently added to or deducted from your account balance.</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="guide-def-card">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">🛑 Max Trades / Day (e.g. 5)</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">A safety speed-limit. It ensures the bot never takes more than 5 trades in a single day, preventing overtrading during turbulent market days.</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="guide-def-card">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">⏱️ 15-Minute Scan Countdown</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">Shows the exact countdown until the bot runs its next automated market check during active trading hours (09:15 AM to 03:30 PM).</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="guide-def-card">
                                <div class="guide-def-term">🗑️ Reset Paper Trading</div>
                                <p class="guide-def-text">A one-click reset button (available to Admin). Clears all test trade history and restores your starting balance back to ₹1,00,000.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

